This directory is intentionally empty in version control.

The Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct model file (qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf,
~1.1 GB) is downloaded into this directory by the GitHub Actions release
workflow (.github/workflows/build-apk.yml) immediately before the Gradle
build, then bundled into the APK as an uncompressed asset.

It is NOT committed to git — a 1.1 GB binary in git history would
permanently bloat every future clone of this repository.

To build locally, download the model yourself and place it here as:
  android/app/src/main/assets/models/qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf

Source (official Qwen repo, ungated, Apache-2.0 licensed — matches the
laptop OS's own model source exactly, see luokai/core/model_engine.py):
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-GGUF
